# Trained policy artifacts live here. Both ONNX policies are committed so a
# fresh clone can run either controller: the state-based policy.onnx (~7 KB)
# and the vision policy_vision.onnx (~1 MB). Their source of truth is the
# training repo's logs/<task>/rsl_rl/<run>/exported/ — MODEL_VERSION.txt
# records which export (path + md5) each committed file is.
# .pt checkpoints stay untracked (multi-MB, reproducible from the run dir).
*.pt
